            "name": "Iggy's Zombie A-Pug-Alypse",
            "steam_appid": 671560,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Iggy is a happy-go-lucky Pug that lives in a mansion with the Duchess Bianca. One day Iggy awakes to find the mansion is overrun with Zombies and Bianca is missing. <br />\r\nCan you reunite Iggy and Bianca in this action packed Puzzle-Strategy game? <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n70 ACTION PACKED LEVELS<br />\r\nSolve every Puzzle your way! Draw any path for Iggy to follow through each Zombie infested level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPUG-LIFE SAVING POWER-UPS<br />\r\nTiming is everything! Activate Power-Ups at the right time and help the little Pug to evade the walking dead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKNOW YOUR ZOMBIES<br />\r\nBraaaains! Help Iggy outmanoeuvre Acid Spitting Zombies, Burning Zombies, Charging Zombies, Electrifying Zombies and many more using perfect timing and your own strategy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBONUS LEVELS<br />\r\nCollect them all! Unlock all 7 Bonus Levels by beating the high scores of every world.",
